  "name": "ISO 16889 Beta Ratio to Filtration Efficiency Conversion Table",
  "description": "Conversion between ISO 16889:2022 Beta ratio β_x(c) and single-pass filtration efficiency percentage. The Beta ratio is the ratio of upstream to downstream particle count at a given size threshold, measured by multi-pass test with ISO 11171-calibrated automatic particle counters.",
